   "en": "The ⟦0⟧ is a minor country in Western Europe with a population of ⟦1⟧ (core) and an additional ⟦2⟧ (non-core). It borders ⟦3⟧ and ⟦4⟧ on the continent to its east and south, as well as ⟦5⟧ and the ⟦6⟧ overseas. The Netherlands rules a relatively big colonial empire, mainly through its ⟦7⟧ of the ⟦8⟧ in Southeast Asia, but it also includes colonies in South America and the Caribbean.",
